Package: AKME
Title: Adjusted Kaplan-Meier Estimator for Right-Censored, Site-Weighted Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Clint", "Noack", email = "clint.noack@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes an adjusted (weighted) Kaplan-Meier estimator of the
    survival function for right-censored concentration data sampled
    unevenly across sites, following Xie and Liu (2005). Provides the
    weighted log-rank test of Singh et al. (2014) for comparing two
    groups via permutation, bootstrap, or simulation, along with quantile
    estimation, Greenwood standard errors, and ggplot2-based plotting
    helpers.
